 1|: UNMAP  0F1 MEMAP!  ;  ( for GAS TERSE )                       
 2|HERE CONSTANT .eot  ( end of root terse )                       
 3|0 VARIABLE .o ( #blks .eot-4000 ) 0 VARIABLE .t ( 4000-8000 )   
 4|0 VARIABLE .h 0 VARIABLE .dp 0 VARIABLE .vp 0 VARIABLE .la      
 5|.o 03FE - CONSTANT .svars                                       
 6|: bload ( from-blk to-addr #blks --- next-blk )                 
 7|  DUP >R 0 DO 2DUP DROP I + BLOCK 2DUP DROP                     
 8|  I 0400 * + 0400 UNPROT BMOVE PROT LOOP DROP R> + ;            
 9|: .rvdl  .vp @ VPTR !  .dp @ DP !  .la @ LAST !  ;              
10|: boot DISKON  .svars 1 bload  .eot .o @ bload                  
11|  04000 .t @ bload  08000 .h @ bload  .rvdl  DROP DISKOFF  ;    
12|UNMAP SCR @ 1+ boot 020 ' T 1- UB! DECIMAL                      
13|32 DIR-BLOCK ! 512 ' BLK/DISK 3 + U!                            
14|FSLD FS.XC                                                      
15|." Xc System 1.0 July 82" ;S                                    

