12|  EIDI THEN SETFDST SETTF SBO HMRFLSH BZERO 3 OFTFCNT B! INNODDS
13|  GAMEOVER B@ IF ELSE F00 SUP 3F00 SUP ( sets "up" ) THEN       
14|  HITYET BONE MYAH S10 ;                                        
