 0|( BB fence hit check does homer set up    HOMERCHK )            
 1|CODE HOMERCHK ( chk for homer or fence hit )                    
 2|  EXX, PSW POP, 5 ADI, FNCY { 1+ } STA, ( 5 rnd +5 for fncy )   
